@verbs skills
@tier player
@title what you can do, and how it is used

  skills

Lists what you can do, by category, and how much you have learnt of
each. The ones marked with (*) are passive: they work by
themselves, you never type them.

Every skill that is not passive is also a verb of its own: if you
know how to hide, hiding is something you can type. Some ask for a
target, some do not.

To find out what one of them does, ask about it:

  help <skill>

That gives you the explanation of that skill, not this list.
